Sinden Lightgun support for EmuELEC
===================================

This package ships the glue required to consume the proprietary Sinden runtime
available from https://sindenlightgun.com/drivers/ and the open-source tooling
maintained by the community (https://github.com/SindenLightgun/SindenLightgunLinux,
https://github.com/mdeguzis/sinden-lightgun-linux).
Pre-built bundles from https://github.com/batocera-linux/batocera-sinden-bundles
are also supported.
Drop the official runtime or one of the community builds into
`/storage/.config/sinden` and the helper scripts will pick it up automatically.

The configuration file lives at `/storage/.config/sinden/sinden.conf` and is
based on the defaults found in `share/defaults/sinden.conf`.  `sinden-controller`
can be used from an SSH shell to tweak behaviour or to trigger manual restarts.
